  ">
    <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/mar/09/ai-nscale-raises-2bn-sheryl-sandberg-nick-clegg-board-value" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">UK AI infrastructure startup Nscale has raised £1.5B in a new funding round, valuing the London-based company at £12.6B</a>. The company also announced that former Meta executives Sheryl Sandberg and Nick Clegg will join its board of directors. Nscale, backed by Nvidia, is building a large AI computing infrastructure, including a planned supercomputer in Loughton.
  </td>
</tr>
