    <mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Art &amp; culture</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.independent.co.uk/news/uk/home-news/international-womens-day-outernet-exhibiton-independent-b2934544.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Portraits of influential women across the UK have been unveiled at an exhibition in London to mark International Women’s Day</a>. The showcase highlights women featured in Independent Women 2026 - The Influence List, celebrating 50 women shaping society across sport, politics, arts, and business. Footballer Chloe Kelly tops this year’s list for her impact on women’s sport. Nine portraits, photographed by Sane Seven, are displayed at Outernet London until the end of March.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/lifestyle/billionaire-joe-lewis-scores-3500-return-masterpieces-art" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">British billionaire Joe Lewis and his family have generated massive gains by selling artworks from their collection at an auction held by Sotheby's in London</a>. Pieces from prominent “School of London” artists, including Francis Bacon, Lucian Freud, and Leon Kossoff, achieved dramatic returns. A 1972 self-portrait by Bacon alone sold for £13.5M. Overall, the artworks produced have gained more than 3,500%.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>
<mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Sports</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
