    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.news18.com/sports/formula-one/toto-wolff-ruining-christian-horners-return-to-f1-mercedes-enter-race-for-alpine-stake-report-ws-l-9951320.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">A potential ownership battle has emerged in F1, with Toto Wolff reportedly leading a bid backed by the Mercedes-AMG Petronas F1 Team to acquire a 24% stake in Alpine F1 Team</a>. The stake is currently owned by Otro Capital. The move could challenge Christian Horner, who is reportedly seeking the same funding as part of a consortium to return to the sport after leaving Red Bull Racing.
  </td>
</tr>
